ADDITIONAL NOTICE

This software is not a medical device. It performs no diagnosis and provides no
treatment recommendation. Measurements it produces are uncalibrated estimates
derived from consumer webcam imagery and have not been validated against any
clinical standard. Nothing in this software should be used as a basis for a
clinical decision, and it is not a substitute for assessment or advice from a
qualified healthcare professional.
